{"id":"d7ad4c352b2a0c12","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-thm-measurable-embed.md","title":"Measurable Embedding Theorem","display":"thm-measurable-embed — Measurable Embedding Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-measurable-embed","aliases":["58-thm-measurable-embed"],"display":"thm-measurable-embed — Measurable Embedding Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch02/58-thm-iterated-ultrapowers.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-measurable-embed"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-measurable-embed</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-measurable-embed — Measurable Embedding Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b4fb7c1808c84d14\" href=\"?note=b4fb7c1808c84d14\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md\">../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0d480b0822a231c2\" href=\"?note=0d480b0822a231c2\" title=\"../batch02/58-thm-iterated-ultrapowers.md\">../batch02/58-thm-iterated-ultrapowers.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:\\mathbf V\\to M\">\\(j:\\mathbf V\\to M\\)</span> is a class function and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> is a transitive proper class</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassElementaryEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(j;\\mathbf V,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassElementaryEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(j;\\mathbf V,M)\\)</span> is the explicit metatheoretic class-embedding predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0d480b0822a231c2\" href=\"?note=0d480b0822a231c2\" title=\"../batch02/58-thm-iterated-ultrapowers.md\">../batch02/58-thm-iterated-ultrapowers.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TransitiveClass}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{TransitiveClass}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(M)\\)</span> abbreviates <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall^{\\mathrm{Class}}x\\,(x\\in M\\to\\forall y\\in x\\;(y\\in M))\">\\(\\forall^{\\mathrm{Class}}x\\,(x\\in M\\to\\forall y\\in x\\;(y\\in M))\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{crit}(j)\">\\(\\operatorname{crit}(j)\\)</span> (critical point)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}embed}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\kappa)\n\\to\n\\exists^{\\mathrm{Class}}M,j\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{TransitiveClass}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(M)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ClassElementaryEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(j;\\mathbf V,M)\n\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\n\\land j(\\kappa)&gt;\\kappa\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}embed}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\kappa)\n\\to\n\\exists^{\\mathrm{Class}}M,j\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{TransitiveClass}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(M)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ClassElementaryEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(j;\\mathbf V,M)\n\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\n\\land j(\\kappa)&gt;\\kappa\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Measurable cardinals give rise to elementary embeddings <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j: V \\to M\">\\(j: V \\to M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The quantifiers over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,j\">\\(M,j\\)</span> are explicitly class-level and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf V\">\\(\\mathbf V\\)</span> is not passed to a set-coded predicate.</li>\n<li>The assertion no longer applies the set-structure predicate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> to the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"b4fb7c1808c84d14","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-thm-iterated-ultrapowers.md","status":"resolved","id":"0d480b0822a231c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-thm-iterated-ultrapowers.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-thm-iterated-ultrapowers.md","status":"resolved","id":"0d480b0822a231c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ClassElementaryEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(j;\\mathbf V,M)$ is the explicit metatheoretic class-embedding predicate from [[../batch02/58-thm-iterated-ultrapowers.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"j:\\mathbf V\\to M","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClassElementaryEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(j;\\mathbf V,M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TransitiveClass}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall^{\\mathrm{Class}}x\\,(x\\in M\\to\\forall y\\in x\\;(y\\in M))","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{crit}(j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}embed}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\kappa)\n\\to\n\\exists^{\\mathrm{Class}}M,j\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{TransitiveClass}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(M)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ClassElementaryEmbedding}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(j;\\mathbf V,M)\n\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\n\\land j(\\kappa)>\\kappa\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"j: V \\to M","display":false},{"tex":"M,j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1551,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4305","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-thm-measurable-embed.md|58-thm-measurable-embed]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["b4fb7c1808c84d14","0d480b0822a231c2"]}